config SPRD_MAP
	tristate "Unisoc map_user (mmap reserved memory, VXTux port)"
	depends on OF
	help
	  Unisoc map_user misc driver (GPL 5.4 -> 6.18 port). Provides /dev/map_user
	  for mmap reserved memory (faceid-mem) by vendor userspace. ABI ioctl
	  kept identical to blob.
